                "description": "Emtek's Athena Lever with Neos Rose is a simple lever with a modern design. It is paired with the rectangular Neos Rose that transforms this leverset into something truly contemporary. The Athena Lever with Neos Rectangular Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This modern brass door lever will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick.",
